nTherefore, the highlighted region represents $x<-2$ or $x>2.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186447247 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186138537 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "32daa2fb-e5fa-5e44-b6f2-5d815d9145af" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying \"Or\" Inequalities Given on Number Lines"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ae9a9300-b57b-5372-b60a-9cb5e5cfc19e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\ge" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186447230}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ae9a9300-b57b-5372-b60a-9cb5e5cfc19e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\ge" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186447230} :answer-field/id #uuid "a31d8aac-4a83-54fc-810d-72ae86787156" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186447242} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2213c361-0498-5c03-9c21-011df8f6c91b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "<" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186447219}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2213c361-0498-5c03-9c21-011df8f6c91b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "<" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186447219} :answer-field/id #uuid "dda1edb5-23e2-5439-94a9-f3319997eb31" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186447245}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "322d7cc1-ec63-5690-b8ff-cb69089ad748" :question/math-academy-id "q-181311" :question/problem "![](images/26/264828b133192b7fff74cfef0718ec56cf82d638003bb9774c2318cb3ae2cc2c.png)\n\nThe inequality corresponding to the highlighted region shown above is $x${{field-1}}\n$1\\text{ or }x$\n{{field-2}}$4.$" :question/